ting enough  rest but in reality it was because he  was ingesting too many vitamins at first  he felt super strong like he could lift  a car over his head from all of the  vitamin D but later his body couldn't  handle the vitamins and Jonah had to be  hospitalized Gina Rodriguez the Jane the  virgin star was only 26 years old when  she was diagnosed with Hashimoto's  disease this is an autoimmune condition  that impacts the thyroid glands it  causes fatigue joint pain wheat gained  in memory loss when you're an actress  who needs to memorize lines a foggy  memory can be a major problem you know I  would fight depression and I would fight  my body changing Gina shared that she  really transformed her condition by  eating healthy and exercising  she said that eating a well-balanced  diet and staying active helps her feel  energetic and happy  emma watson when emma watson was on set  filming Darren Aronofsky's movie Noah  she got pretty sick the film has a  pro-environment message because of this  Darren didn't want anyone drinking from  water bottles on set emma was exhausted  and delirious from working long hours  without thinking she reached for a mug  and drink water that had been sitting in  the trailer and growing bacteria for  three months she got so sick but the  director insisted that she keep on  filming Channing Tatum while filming the  movie Eagle Channing Tatum suffered a  very unfortunate injury he had to get  into this freezing cold Scottish River  the crew was supposed to keep him warm  by mixing boiling water with river water  and pouring it into his wetsuit but the  crew member forgot to mix in the river  water so Shannon had straight boiling  water poured over a very sensitive area  of his body he had to be hospitalized  luckily he recovered and everything is  fine now  ouch Lena Dunham Lena Dunham disclosed  that she has suffered from endometriosis  for over a decade  I've always grappled with my physical  health I've grappled with my mental  health